{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123655","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123655/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123655/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123655/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123655","id":5518625254,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEUOaSg","number":123655,"title":"Add Semantic Rename Symbol feature to the GDScript text editor","user":{"login":"bkcetinkaya","id":46684966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Njg0OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46684966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya","html_url":"https://github.com/bkcetinkaya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkcetinkaya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-20T15:09:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T08:41:17Z","closed_at":"2026-09-21T08:41:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123655","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123655","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123655.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123655.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Add semantic Rename Symbol feature to the GDScript text editor\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n<img width=\"1202\" height=\"878\" alt=\"demo\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eada99ed-1172-4cc7-857c-fa6b1d67e278\" />\r\n\r\n- Implements a native, semantic \"Rename Symbol\" feature in the Godot Script Editor.\r\n- Allows developers to safely rename local and global/member variables across a script using `GDScriptParser` to build an Abstract Syntax Tree (AST), ensuring renames ignore comments and string literals.\r\n- Adds a user-facing `ConfirmationDialog` and `LineEdit` input popup triggered via the right-click context menu (or shortcut), integrated with standard undo/redo history (`Ctrl+Z`).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### Implementation Details\r\n- **AST Resolution**: Walks function statements and expressions to isolate valid identifier nodes matching the symbol under the text caret, supporting both strict local variable bindings and name-based global/member fallbacks.\r\n- **Text Replacement**: Uses reverse-order replacement (`remove_text` / `insert_text` from bottom-to-top, right-to-left) wrapped in a complex undo operation to preserve coordinate integrity.\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure\r\n- AI assistance (Gemini) was utilized during the development process to help structure the AST visitor pattern logic, design the hybrid search/replacement boundaries, and troubleshoot editor UI layout bindings.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123655/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123655/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}